{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Gladly. We are happy to finally be free of this burden. Violet is a poison given life, an agent of King George, and likely his best Saboteur. She was the vial of mercury used to change the king, and take on many of his characteristics. She lives deep in the Noir. And aids any who come to her with intentions to destroy the rebellion. She has employed the power we have invested in the Noir to remove her self of the guilt she feels when murdering. The murders seem political in nature, but we also suspect a fiendish involvement. She is a master of time, and employs many potions to remain beyond detection. \"","created_at":"2021-08-15T04:31:58.213000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-15T04:32:17.373000Z","id":"876322302567018516","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
